&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For our global Customer Engagement team in Berlin, we are looking for a Lifecycle Marketing Manager to own the lifecycle strategy for one of our core topics: AOV, merchandising, partnerships &amp;amp; retail media, or unpausing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customer Engagement sits within the HelloFresh Group’s Global Customer Lifecycle organization. Our mission is simple: keep active customers active, and make sure they get the most out of their subscription — across our 6 brands, 18 countries and 30 markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lifecycle Marketing Manager, you’ll be a critical link between strategy and execution, partnering closely with CRM, Product Marketing, Physical Product, Tech and local marketing teams to design, brief and scale programs that keep our customers engaged with their subscription.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the lifecycle strategy deployment for your topic area and translate it into programs and campaigns that keep customers engaged with their subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Marketing, Physical Product and Tech to spot opportunities that improve the customer experience and support your topic’s goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief campaigns end-to-end to CRM Operations and Creative teams, ensuring messaging, targeting and execution meet our lifecycle and brand standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with local market teams across our 30 markets to adapt and roll out global strategy, balancing consistency with local relevance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to test, measure and continuously optimize campaign performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on the health of your topic area, flagging risks and opportunities to the wider Customer Engagement team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cross-topic initiatives across the Customer Engagement team as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen — experience operating in a highly commercial function (not necessarily CRM), with the ability to bridge lifecycle marketing thinking with commercial opportunities, and to create opportunity rather than just streamline execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A successful experience (3+ years) in CRM, lifecycle marketing, product marketing or a similar role, ideally in a subscription, e-commerce or FMCG environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills, with experience briefing and managing cross-functional stakeholders (CRM Operations, Creative, Tech, local teams)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical mindset — comfortable using data to inform decisions and optimize campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities independently, across global and local stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English; &lt;em&gt;notions of German, French, Dutch, Swedish, Norwegian or Danish is a plus&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Marketing, Business or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re excited about driving measurable reactivation uplift across the world, we&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;SLSQ427R367&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;Databricks operates at the leading edge of the unified data, analytics and AI space. Our customers turn to us to lead the accelerated innovation their businesses need to gain first‑mover advantage in today’s ultra‑competitive landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;As we continue our rapid expansion across Central Europe, we are looking for a creative, execution‑oriented Strategic Account Executive to join the team in Germany and maximise the phenomenal market opportunity that exists for Databricks within the automotive/OEM vertical. Reporting to our Senior Director of Enterprise Sales, you will focus on building relationships and closing new business opportunities within one of Germany’s largest automotive/OEM company. You will be part of an account team supporting this highly strategic client. Leveraging your consultative sales experience in the automotive/OEM vertical, you will help shape the data and AI strategy, identify and progress high-value opportunities, and deliver tangible business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;marker:text-quiet list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will take ownership of your flagship account, define a clear strategy, and relentlessly drive it to exceed revenue and consumption goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will turn that strategy into action, executing with urgency and discipline to consistently overachieve your targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will build boardroom‑level relationships, becoming the trusted advisor on all things data and AI for senior stakeholders up to and including C‑level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will uncover and shape new business, expanding use cases and driving deeper platform consumption across your account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will orchestrate the full Databricks ecosystem, mobilising internal teams to maximise impact and customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will demonstrate compelling value in every engagement, leading confident, insight‑led negotiations that take opportunities all the way to close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;What we look for&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;439&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;A proven record of exceeding revenue targets in complex enterprise sales environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;439&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;Recognised automotive domain expertise, applied to expanding strategic automotive/OEM accounts in Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;711&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;713&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot;&gt;Proven success selling data, analytics, big data, AI, or other highly technical cloud software solutions through complex, multi-stakeholder, multi-year enterprise sales cycles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to identify high-impact data and AI use cases and engage key buying centres to expand Databricks’ footprint and strategic relevance within an organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;864&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;866&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of consumption-based, land-and-expand models, with the ability to drive sustained growth within a single strategic account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1013&quot; data-end=&quot;1129&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1015&quot; data-end=&quot;1129&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to create and shape demand, translating customer priorities into measurable business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1130&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1132&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;Disciplined use of sales methodologies such as MEDDPICC, account planning, Value Selling, or Command of the Message, combined with strong pipeline management and accurate forecasting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1320&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;A track record of building executive-level champions and cross-functional account teams to execute against a defined account and territory strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1473&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;Experience developing and executing partner strategies that extend reach, accelerate deal velocity, and support complex enterprise opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1621&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1623&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;Willing and able to travel to customer sites, company and industry events - regionally and internationally&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1793&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1795&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;Fluent in German and English, with the credibility to engage, challenge, and influence senior stakeholders up to C-level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the data and AI company. More than 10,000 organizations worldwide — including Comcast, Condé Nast, Grammarly, and over 50% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data Intelligence Platform to unify and democratize data, analytics and AI. Databricks is headquartered in San Francisco, with offices around the globe and was founded by the original creators of Lakehouse, Apache Spark™, Delta Lake and MLflow. To learn more, follow Databricks on&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 54, 33);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 54, 33);&quot; href=&quot;https://twitter.com/databricks&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://twitter.com/databricks&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1700237575733000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw03FL8fJvOD97ytN02f5G2C&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 54, 33);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1700237575733000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw15dLk3q8VxTfHEgCUg7NSt&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 54, 33);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/databricksinc&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.facebook.com/databricksinc&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1700237575733000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw39EcncitnlqV72EG2-RqXJ&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allow us to introduce ourselves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hello there! We’re Appinio, a global market research company that combines an AI-powered insights platform with expert consultancy. On a mission to make the world a little more fact-based, we help companies understand how consumers think and make smarter decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started out in Hamburg back in 2014, but we’re now humbled to call the world our playground, with over &lt;strong&gt;260 employees&lt;/strong&gt; spread across &lt;strong&gt;13 countries &lt;/strong&gt;(we’re remote-first), 2600+ international clients, delivering research from &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;+190 markets,&lt;/strong&gt; globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to be a part of the Appinio movement? &lt;strong&gt;🚀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Here at Appinio, we value &lt;strong&gt;transparency&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;in our recruitment process&lt;/strong&gt;, and we&#39;ve created a blog to share what to expect during each step of our journey together:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;https://www.appinio.com/en/blog/life-at-appinio/appinio-recruitment-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.appinio.com/en/blog/life-at-appinio/appinio-recruitment-process&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;role&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-ad-editable job-ad-editable job-ad-editor&quot; data-content=&quot;6454830&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission as a Senior Backend Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a passionate (&lt;strong&gt;Senior)&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Backend Engineer (m/f/d)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our amazing backend team. In this role, you will be responsible for developing new features and enhancing our existing code base using NodeJs, Express, and MongoDB. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and maintain server-side applications and database architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with front-end developers for a seamless user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly review and improve code and system efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deploy reusable, testable code and automated tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will thrive in this role if&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least 3 years of hands-on experience with Node.js, along with strong proficiency in TypeScript and Express.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have practical experience working with NoSQL databases, preferably MongoDB.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a solid understanding of object-oriented programming principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a degree in Computer Science or a related field – or have completed a comparable vocational training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Having AWS (S3, ECS, EC2), Docker and Terraform experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Having previous experience with NestJS is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a proactive problem solver, always seeking innovative solutions and continuously improving processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are willing and able to get familiar with new systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a team player and enjoy collaborating with cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a collaborative environment, valuing team input and ensuring alignment with project goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We work in small, agile product teams with lots of ownership and fast decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll collaborate with smart, driven, and genuinely nice people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We keep meetings to a minimum – focus time matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We use a modern tech stack that supports us in building great products:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend: Node.js (TypeScript), Express, MongoDB, AWS, Docker, Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontend: Angular, Flutter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tools we love: GitHub, ClickUp, Slack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Flexibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; - Average is 30 days taken, however, we do not have a hard cap of number of vacation days as we know life happens&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Temporary work from abroad - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re based in the EU, you can work outside your country of residence for up to 180 days per year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;All the hardware you need and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;your own MacBook&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If you are located in Hamburg or Berlin, you&#39;ll get a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Deutschland ticket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; or access to a mobility budget with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;NAVIT app&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; to get you to and from the office space&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised &lt;strong&gt;Urban Sports Club &lt;/strong&gt;or &lt;strong&gt;ClassPass&lt;/strong&gt; membership based on location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;In case&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; you’re located in one of the cities where most of our fellow Appinioneers are (Hamburg, Berlin, Munich, London, Madrid, Barcelona, or New York), you can get access to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Co-working spaces&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Additional role details&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;fully remote position&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;open to candidates based in Germany, the UK, Portugal, the Netherlands, and Spain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will report directly to our Head of Infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our interview process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Screening Call with a Talent Acquisition Partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Interview with&amp;nbsp; our Engineering Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case Study Interview with our Engineering Leadership Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive Interview with C-Level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reference Calls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;job-ad-editable job-ad-editable job-ad-editor&quot; data-content=&quot;6454846&quot;&gt;
